{
  "id": "m30l2",
  "title": {
    "es": "Más recursión",
    "en": "More recursion"
  },
  "theory": {
    "es": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "value": "Potencias y listas"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "La recursión sirve para muchos problemas: potencias, recorrer estructuras anidadas, dividir y vencer… La clave es siempre encontrar el caso base."
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "value": [
          "def potencia(base, exp):",
          "    if exp == 0:",
          "        return 1",
          "    return base * potencia(base, exp - 1)",
          "",
          "print(potencia(2, 5))"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "output",
        "value": [
          "32"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "value": "Cuidado con recursiones muy profundas: Python limita la pila (~1000 llamadas)."
      }
    ],
    "en": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "value": "Powers and lists"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "Recursion solves many problems: powers, traversing nested structures, divide and conquer… The key is always finding the base case."
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "value": [
          "def potencia(base, exp):",
          "    if exp == 0:",
          "        return 1",
          "    return base * potencia(base, exp - 1)",
          "",
          "print(potencia(2, 5))"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "output",
        "value": [
          "32"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "value": "Beware very deep recursion: Python limits the stack (~1000 calls)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "exercises": [
    {
      "id": "m30l2e1",
      "prompt": {
        "es": "Define `potencia(base, exp)` de forma recursiva (exp >= 0), sin usar **.",
        "en": "Define `potencia(base, exp)` recursively (exp >= 0), without using **."
      },
      "starter_code": [
        "def potencia(base, exp):",
        "    pass"
      ],
      "solution": [
        "def potencia(base, exp):",
        "    if exp == 0:",
        "        return 1",
        "    return base * potencia(base, exp - 1)"
      ],
      "hints": {
        "es": [
          "Caso base exp==0 -> 1; si no, base * potencia(base, exp-1)."
        ],
        "en": [
          "Base case exp==0 -> 1; else base * potencia(base, exp-1)."
        ]
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": "potencia",
          "cases": [
            {
              "args": [
                2,
                5
              ],
              "expected": 32
            },
            {
              "args": [
                5,
                0
              ],
              "expected": 1
            },
            {
              "args": [
                3,
                3
              ],
              "expected": 27
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "m30l2e2",
      "prompt": {
        "es": "Define `cuenta_atras(n)` que devuelva la lista [n, n-1, ..., 1] de forma recursiva.",
        "en": "Define `cuenta_atras(n)` returning the list [n, n-1, ..., 1] recursively."
      },
      "starter_code": [
        "def cuenta_atras(n):",
        "    pass"
      ],
      "solution": [
        "def cuenta_atras(n):",
        "    if n <= 0:",
        "        return []",
        "    return [n] + cuenta_atras(n - 1)"
      ],
      "hints": {
        "es": [
          "Caso base n<=0 -> []; si no, [n] + cuenta_atras(n-1)."
        ],
        "en": [
          "Base case n<=0 -> []; else [n] + cuenta_atras(n-1)."
        ]
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": "cuenta_atras",
          "cases": [
            {
              "args": [
                3
              ],
              "expected": [
                3,
                2,
                1
              ]
            },
            {
              "args": [
                0
              ],
              "expected": []
            },
            {
              "args": [
                1
              ],
              "expected": [
                1
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}